{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42811","headline":"登郡楼书怀 一 · 刘兼","name":"登郡楼书怀 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟雨楼台渐晦冥，锦江澄碧浪花平。\n卞和未雪荆山耻，庄舃空伤越国情。\n天际寂寥无雁下，云端依约有僧行。\n登高欲继离骚咏，魂断愁深写不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}